# GET API Requests

## Overview

This document provides examples of **GET API requests** for manual API testing. These requests are used to retrieve resources such as users, products, and reviews from an API.

Each example includes the HTTP method, endpoint, required headers, expected response status, response body, and relevant validation scenarios.

